  "summary": "xapi-lib preinstall beacon to hardcoded third-party host",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall hook that runs index.js, whose top-level code unconditionally issues an HTTPS GET to https://realwbx.com/ip.php with a hardcoded Authorization token on every install. The destination host is unrelated to any declared publisher or documented SDK, and the request reveals the installer's public IP and install event to that third-party host. Package metadata is generic (terse description, anonymous author handle `conx3993`, name shape `xapi-lib`) and does not identify a legitimate first-party owner for the beacon endpoint. No README-documented purpose or opt-out exists for this install-time network call.",
